    "barem": "Introduction: Paraphrase.\nOverview: General upward trend for 2 airports; LaGuardia leads by 2000.\nBody 1: LaGuardia detailed growth (35m to 68m).\nBody 2: JFK (fluctuating peaks) and Newark (initial rise to 42m).\nConclusion: Summary.",
