    "barem": "Introduction: Paraphrase.\nOverview: Female dominance in early education; male dominance in higher levels.\nBody 1: Nursery and Primary sectors (overwhelming female presence).\nBody 2: Secondary vs Higher education (gender shift and male lead in Uni).\nConclusion: Summary.",
