    "barem": "Introduction: Paraphrase.\nOverview: Women spend more total time; gendered division of labor exists.\nBody 1: Kitchen, Cleaning, and Childcare (female leads).\nBody 2: Gardening, DIY, and Pet care (male leads).\nConclusion: Summary.",
